# Supply / ground bonds on free signal sites (D12; bond_map.txt gives the site and the reason of each). Provider supply
# cell at a signal site (demand master until the pads owner confirms it: D-SPLIT-SUPSITE); no COB capacitor on these fingers.
inst pad_xvss_{0:8} prov_supply_sig chip
  PAD~VSS
inst pad_xvdd_{0:1} prov_supply_sig chip
  PAD~VDD
